completed_at: "2026-09-08T06:55:54.591Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: The request-metadata parser accepts and validates io.modelcontextprotocol/logLevel against the specification enum and refuses an invalid level with -32602; A negative control proves no notifications/message frame is emitted on stdio and Streamable HTTP for a request that omits the key; The conformance matrix gains the row with owner and executable evidence and the deprecation inventory stays green
parent: pm-rs9vry
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: The public SDK validates request-local MCP logLevel metadata against all eight severities and rejects malformed values with -32602; real stdio and HTTP transports prove omitted metadata cannot emit protocol logging.
expected_result: "Accept the optional deprecated metadata interoperably without request-state carryover, unauthorized notifications or CLI-only logic."
actual_result: 38 focused SDK/stdio/HTTP tests pass; the full sandbox suite and exact coverage gate pass. Conformance documentation and additive public SDK snapshot are updated. Publication remains a separate release acceptance step.
